{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"bodyItems-wrapper\">    科技｜《GTA 6》開售　邁阿密變現實版罪惡都市　熱火限定球衣90分鐘售罄           <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left tight-spacing neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">全球玩家等候多時的《GTA 6》（Grand Theft Auto VI）周四（19日）正式推出，開發商Rockstar Games在美國邁阿密展開大型宣傳，把當地塑造成遊戲內罪惡都市Vice City的現實版。邁阿密熱火周三（18日）主場迎戰密爾沃基公鹿時換上特別版球衣，每件售120美元（約936港元），有球迷提早兩小時排隊，場內貨品約90分鐘售罄。遊戲中虛構的Burger Shot及Cluckin' Bell在球場開設實體攤位，比斯坎灣上空則有無人機燈光表演。  </p> </div> </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T08:43:52.065892+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":272,"images":0,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T19:00:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T08:37:36.367938+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T08:37:36.367938+00:00","content_hash":"51236efce9ca5c8cf9ae491d18d64ea2e7cdba79f5006cb6e6de019b01325b74","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}